File: EdgeIdeals.info, Node: completeGraph, Next: completeMultiPartite, Prev: complementGraph, Up: Top

completeGraph -- returns a complete graph
*****************************************

  * Usage: 
        K = completeGraph R
        K = completeGraph(R,n)
        K = completeGraph L
  * Inputs:
      * R, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, 
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, number of variables to use
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of vertices to make into a
        complete graph
  * Outputs:
      * K, a *note graph: Graph,, a complete graph on the vertices in L or on
        the variables of R

Description
===========

This function returns a special graph, the complete graph.  The input specifies
a set of vertices that will have the property that every vertex is adjacent to
every other vertex.  Non-specified vertices are treated as isolated vertices.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a,b,c,d,e];                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : completeGraph R                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {a, c}, {a, d}, {a, e}, {b, c}, {b, d}, {b,   |
|           "ring" => R                                                       |
|           "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Graph                                                                   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|e}, {c, d}, {c, e}, {d, e}}}                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : completeGraph(R,3)                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {a, c}, {b, c}}}                              |
|           "ring" => R                                                       |
|           "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Graph                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : completeGraph {a,c,e}                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = Graph{"edges" => {{a, c}, {a, e}, {c, e}}}                              |
|           "ring" => R                                                       |
|           "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : Graph                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

