coverIdeal -- creates the cover ideal of a (hyper)graph
*******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        I = coverIdeal H
  * Inputs:
      * H, a *note hypergraph: HyperGraph,, 
  * Outputs:
      * I, a *note monomial ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)MonomialIdeal,, the cover
        ideal of H

Description
===========

Returns the monomial ideal generated by the minimal vertex covers.  This is
also the Alexander dual of the edge ideal of the hypergraph H.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = QQ[a,b,c,d,e,f];                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : k6 = completeGraph S  -- complete graph on 6 vertices                   |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {a, c}, {a, d}, {a, e}, {a, f}, {b, c}, {b,   |
|           "ring" => S                                                       |
|           "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e, f}                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Graph                                                                   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|d}, {b, e}, {b, f}, {c, d}, {c, e}, {c, f}, {d, e}, {d, f}, {e, f}}}         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : coverIdeal k6 -- each generator corresponds to a minimal vertex of k6   |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = monomialIdeal (a*b*c*d*e, a*b*c*d*f, a*b*c*e*f, a*b*d*e*f, a*c*d*e*f,   |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     b*c*d*e*f)                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : MonomialIdeal of S                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : h = hyperGraph {a*b*c,c*d,d*e*f}                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = HyperGraph{"edges" => {{a, b, c}, {c, d}, {d, e, f}}}                   |
|                "ring" => S                                                  |
|                "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e, f}                             |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : HyperGraph                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : coverIdeal h                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = monomialIdeal (a*d, b*d, c*d, c*e, c*f)                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : MonomialIdeal of S                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : dual coverIdeal h == edgeIdeal h                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note dual: (Macaulay2Doc)dual, -- dual module or map
  * *note edgeIdeal: edgeIdeal, -- creates the edge ideal of a (hyper)graph
  * *note vertexCoverNumber: vertexCoverNumber, -- find the vertex covering
    number of a (hyper)graph
  * *note vertexCovers: vertexCovers, -- list the minimal vertex covers of a
    (hyper)graph

Ways to use coverIdeal:
=======================

