degreeVertex -- returns the degree of a vertex
**********************************************

  * Usage: 
        d = degreeVertex(H,n)
        d = degreeVertex(H,V)
  * Inputs:
      * H, a *note hypergraph: HyperGraph,, 
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the index of a vertex
      * V, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, a vertex/variable
        of the HyperGraph
  * Outputs:
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the degree of vertex V (or
        vertex number n)

Description
===========

The degree of a vertex in a (hyper)graph is the number of edges that contain
the vertex. In a graph, the degree is also the number of elements in the
neighbor set of a vertex.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = QQ[a,b,c,d,e];                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : k5 = completeGraph S                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {a, c}, {a, d}, {a, e}, {b, c}, {b, d}, {b,   |
|           "ring" => S                                                       |
|           "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Graph                                                                   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|e}, {c, d}, {c, e}, {d, e}}}                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : dv = degreeVertex(k5,a)                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 4                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : n = neighbors(k5,a)                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = {b, c, d, e}                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : #n == dv                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : degreeVertex(k5,2)                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = 4                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : h = hyperGraph {a*b*c,c*d,a*d*e,b*e,c*e}                                |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = HyperGraph{"edges" => {{a, b, c}, {c, d}, {b, e}, {c, e}, {a, d, e}}}   |
|                "ring" => S                                                  |
|                "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                                |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : HyperGraph                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : degreeVertex(h,a)                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = 2                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : degreeVertex(h,2) -- degree of c                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = 3                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note neighbors: neighbors, -- returns the neighbors of a vertex or list of
    vertices
  * *note vertices(HyperGraph): vertices_lpHyperGraph_rp, -- gets the vertices
    of a (hyper)graph

