deleteEdges -- returns the (hyper)graph with specified edges removed
********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        h = deleteEdges(H, S)
  * Inputs:
      * H, a *note hypergraph: HyperGraph,, 
      * S, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a subset of the edges of the
        graph or hypergraph
  * Outputs:
      * h, a *note hypergraph: HyperGraph,, the hypergraph with edges in S
        removed

Description
===========

This function enables the user to remove specified edges from a hypergraph to
form a subhypergraph.

+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = QQ[a,b,c,d,e];                                        |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : g = cycle S                                               |
|                                                               |
|o2 = Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {b, c}, {c, d}, {d, e}, {a, e}}}|
|           "ring" => S                                         |
|           "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                       |
|                                                               |
|o2 : Graph                                                     |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : T = {{a,b},{d,e}}                                         |
|                                                               |
|o3 = {{a, b}, {d, e}}                                          |
|                                                               |
|o3 : List                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : gprime = deleteEdges (g,T)                                |
|                                                               |
|o4 = HyperGraph{"edges" => {{b, c}, {a, e}, {c, d}}}           |
|                "ring" => S                                    |
|                "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                  |
|                                                               |
|o4 : HyperGraph                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : h = hyperGraph {a*b*c,c*d*e,a*e}                          |
|                                                               |
|o5 = HyperGraph{"edges" => {{a, b, c}, {a, e}, {c, d, e}}}     |
|                "ring" => S                                    |
|                "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                  |
|                                                               |
|o5 : HyperGraph                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : T = edges h                                               |
|                                                               |
|o6 = {{a, b, c}, {a, e}, {c, d, e}}                            |
|                                                               |
|o6 : List                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : hprime = deleteEdges (h,T)                                |
|                                                               |
|o7 = HyperGraph{"edges" => {}                }                 |
|                "ring" => S                                    |
|                "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                  |
|                                                               |
|o7 : HyperGraph                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+

