edges -- gets the edges of a (hyper)graph
*****************************************

  * Usage: 
        E = edges(H)
  * Inputs:
      * H, a *note hypergraph: HyperGraph,, 
  * Outputs:
      * E, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of the edges of H

Description
===========

This function takes a (hyper)graph, and returns the edge set of the
(hyper)graph.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = QQ[a..d];                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : g = graph {a*b,b*c,c*d,d*a} -- the four cycle                     |
