getEdge -- gets the n-th edge in a (hyper)graph
***********************************************

  * Usage: 
        E = getEdge(H,n)
  * Inputs:
      * H, a *note hypergraph: HyperGraph,, 
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, an index of an edge in H
  * Outputs:
      * E, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the n-th edge of H

Description
===========

This function returns the n^{th} edge of the (hyper)graph.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = QQ[a..f];                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : g = cycle S                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {b, c}, {c, d}, {d, e}, {e, f}, {a, f}}}      |
|           "ring" => S                                                       |
|           "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e, f}                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Graph                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : edges g                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = {{a, b}, {b, c}, {c, d}, {d, e}, {e, f}, {a, f}}                        |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : getEdge (g,3)  -- counting starts from 0, so the 4th element in the     |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = {d, e}                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : List                                                                    |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|above list                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : h = hyperGraph {a*b*c*d,d*e,a*f*c,a*d*f}                                |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = HyperGraph{"edges" => {{a, b, c, d}, {d, e}, {a, c, f}, {a, d, f}}}     |
|                "ring" => S                                                  |
|                "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e, f}                             |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : HyperGraph                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : getEdge (h,0) -- first edge                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = {a, b, c, d}                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

