getEdgeIndex -- finds the index of an edge in a HyperGraph
**********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        n = getEdgeIndex(H,E)
        n = getEdgeIndex(H,M)
  * Inputs:
      * H, a *note hypergraph: HyperGraph,, 
      * E, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of vertices
      * M, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, a monomial that is
        the product of vertices
  * Outputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the index of E as an edge of H.
        If E is not in H, then -1 is returned.

Description
===========

This function returns the index of the edge of the (hyper)graph, where the
ordering is determined by the internal ordering of the edges. Note that the
internal order of the edges may not be preserved by methods that change the
hypergraph (i.e., *note inducedHyperGraph: inducedHyperGraph,, *note
changeRing: changeRing,, *note hyperGraph(MonomialIdeal): hyperGraph,, etc.).

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = QQ[z_1..z_8];                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : h = hyperGraph {z_2*z_3*z_4,z_6*z_8,z_7*z_5,z_1*z_6*z_7,z_2*z_4*z_8}    |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = HyperGraph{"edges" => {{z , z , z }, {z , z }, {z , z , z }, {z , z ,   |
|                              2   3   4     5   7     1   6   7     2   4    |
|                "ring" => S                                                  |
|                "vertices" => {z , z , z , z , z , z , z , z }               |
|                                1   2   3   4   5   6   7   8                |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : HyperGraph                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|z }, {z , z }}}                                                              |
| 8     6   8                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : edges h                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = {{z , z , z }, {z , z }, {z , z , z }, {z , z , z }, {z , z }}          |
|        2   3   4     5   7     1   6   7     2   4   8     6   8            |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : getEdgeIndex (h,{z_2,z_4,z_8})  -- although entered last, edge is       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = 3                                                                       |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|internally stored in 4th spot (counting begins at 0)                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : getEdge(h,3)                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = {z , z , z }                                                            |
|       2   4   8                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : getEdgeIndex (h,{z_1,z_2}) -- not in the edge list                      |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = -1                                                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

