|                                                               |
|o4 = {{a, b, c, d}, {b, c, d, e}, {c, d, f}, {d, g}, {e, f, g}}|
|                                                               |
|o4 : List                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : getGoodLeafIndex(H)                                       |
|                                                               |
|o5 = 0                                                         |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+

