hyperGraphToSimplicialComplex -- makes a simplicial complex from a (hyper)graph
*******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        D = hyperGraphToSimplicialComplex H
  * Inputs:
      * H, a *note hypergraph: HyperGraph,, 
  * Outputs:
      * D, an *note abstract simplicial complex:
        (SimplicialComplexes)SimplicialComplex,, whose facets are given by the
        edges of H

Description
===========

This function produces a simplicial complex from a (hyper)graph. The facets of
the simplicial complex are given by the edge set of the (hyper)graph. This
function is the inverse of *note simplicialComplexToHyperGraph:
simplicialComplexToHyperGraph, and enables users to make use of functions in
the package *note SimplicialComplexes: (SimplicialComplexes)Top,.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x_1..x_6];                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : G = graph({x_1*x_2,x_2*x_3,x_3*x_4,x_4*x_5,x_1*x_5,x_1*x_6,x_5*x_6}) --5|
|                                                                             |
|o2 = Graph{"edges" => {{x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x }, {x ,|
|                         1   2     2   3     3   4     1   5     4   5     1 |
|           "ring" => R                                                       |
|           "vertices" => {x , x , x , x , x , x }                            |
|                           1   2   3   4   5   6                             |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Graph                                                                   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|-cycle and a triangle                                                        |
|                                                                             |
| x }, {x , x }}}                                                             |
|  6     5   6                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : DeltaG = hyperGraphToSimplicialComplex G                                |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = simplicialComplex | x_5x_6 x_1x_6 x_4x_5 x_1x_5 x_3x_4 x_2x_3 x_1x_2 |  |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : SimplicialComplex                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : hyperGraphDeltaG = simplicialComplexToHyperGraph DeltaG                 |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = HyperGraph{"edges" => {{x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x },|
|                              1   2     2   3     3   4     1   5     4   5  |
|                "ring" => R                                                  |
|                "vertices" => {x , x , x , x , x , x }                       |
|                                1   2   3   4   5   6                        |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : HyperGraph                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{x , x }, {x , x }}}                                                         |
|  1   6     5   6                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : GPrime = graph(hyperGraphDeltaG)                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = Graph{"edges" => {{x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x }, {x ,|
|                         1   2     2   3     3   4     1   5     4   5     1 |
|           "ring" => R                                                       |
|           "vertices" => {x , x , x , x , x , x }                            |
|                           1   2   3   4   5   6                             |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Graph                                                                   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|x }, {x , x }}}                                                              |
| 6     5   6                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : G === GPrime                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

