inducedHyperGraph -- returns the induced subgraph of a (hyper)graph
*******************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        h = inducedHyperGraph(H, L)
  * Inputs:
      * H, a *note hypergraph: HyperGraph,, 
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of vertices (i.e. variables in
