|                "ring" => QQ[b..e]                                           |
|                "vertices" => {b, c, d, e}                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : HyperGraph                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : H2 = inducedHyperGraph(G,{a,b,d,e})                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = HyperGraph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {a, e}, {d, e}}}                         |
|                "ring" => QQ[a..b, d..e]                                     |
|                "vertices" => {a, b, d, e}                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : HyperGraph                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : use ring H1                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = QQ[b..e]                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : inducedHyperGraph(H1,{c,d,e})                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = HyperGraph{"edges" => {{c, d}, {d, e}}}                                 |
|                "ring" => QQ[c..e]                                           |
|                "vertices" => {c, d, e}                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : HyperGraph                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : use ring G                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : inducedHyperGraph(G,{b,c,d,e},OriginalRing=>true) --H1 but in bigger    |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = HyperGraph{"edges" => {{b, c}, {c, d}, {d, e}}}                         |
|                "ring" => R                                                  |
|                "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                                |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : HyperGraph                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|ring                                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Equivalently, one can use *note changeRing: changeRing, to move the induced
hypergraph back into the original ring.

+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : R = QQ[a,b,c,d,e];                                         |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : G = graph {a*b,b*c,c*d,d*e,e*a} -- graph of the 5-cycle   |
|                                                                |
|o10 = Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {b, c}, {c, d}, {a, e}, {d, e}}}|
|            "ring" => R                                         |
|            "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                       |
