lineGraph -- returns the line graph of a (hyper)graph
*****************************************************

  * Usage: 
        L = lineGraph H
  * Inputs:
      * H, a *note hypergraph: HyperGraph,, 
  * Outputs:
      * L, a *note graph: Graph,, the line graph of H

Description
===========

The line graph L of a hypergraph H has a vertex for each edge in H. Two
vertices in L are adjacent if their edges in H share a vertex. The order of the
vertices in L are determined by the implicit order on the edges of H. See *note
edges: edges,.

+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[a..e];                                             |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : G = graph {a*b,a*c,a*d,d*e}                               |
|                                                               |
|o2 = Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {a, c}, {a, d}, {d, e}}}        |
|           "ring" => R                                         |
|           "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                       |
|                                                               |
|o2 : Graph                                                     |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : lineGraph G                                               |
|                                                               |
|o3 = Graph{"edges" => {{x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x }, {x , x }}}|
|                         0   1     0   2     1   2     2   3   |
|           "ring" => QQ[x ..x ]                                |
|                         0   3                                 |
|           "vertices" => {x , x , x , x }                      |
|                           0   1   2   3                       |
|                                                               |
|o3 : Graph                                                     |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note edges: edges, -- gets the edges of a (hyper)graph

