vertexCoverNumber -- find the vertex covering number of a (hyper)graph
**********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        c = vertexCoverNumber(H)
  * Inputs:
      * H, a *note hypergraph: HyperGraph,, the input
  * Outputs:
      * c, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the vertex covering number

Description
===========

This function returns the vertex covering number of a (hyper)graph. The vertex
covering number is the size of smallest vertex cover of the (hyper)graph.  This
corresponds to the smallest degree of a generator of the cover ideal of the
(hyper)graph.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : S = QQ[a..d];                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : g = graph {a*b,b*c,c*d,d*a} -- the four cycle                           |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {b, c}, {a, d}, {c, d}}}                      |
|           "ring" => S                                                       |
|           "vertices" => {a, b, c, d}                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Graph                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : vertexCoverNumber g                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 2                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : S = QQ[a..e];                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : g = graph {a*b,a*c,a*d,a*e,b*c,b*d,b*e,c*d,c*e,d*e} -- the complete     |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = Graph{"edges" => {{a, b}, {a, c}, {b, c}, {a, d}, {b, d}, {c, d}, {a    |
|           "ring" => S                                                       |
|           "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Graph                                                                   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|graph K_5                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|, e}, {b, e}, {c, e}, {d, e}}}                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : vertexCoverNumber g                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = 4                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : h = hyperGraph {a*b*c,a*d,c*e,b*d*e}                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = HyperGraph{"edges" => {{a, b, c}, {a, d}, {c, e}, {b, d, e}}}           |
|                "ring" => S                                                  |
|                "vertices" => {a, b, c, d, e}                                |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : HyperGraph                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : vertexCoverNumber(h)                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = 2                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note coverIdeal: coverIdeal, -- creates the cover ideal of a (hyper)graph
  * *note vertexCovers: vertexCovers, -- list the minimal vertex covers of a
    (hyper)graph

